    "description": "Velvet Pipe & Cigarette Tobacco\nEmpty Metal Pocket Tins Lot of 10 with Original Display Box\nVintage, 1.5 oz Size\nA collection of vintage Velvet brand tobacco tins, a staple of 20th-century American tobacciana. These pocket-sized tins feature the iconic red lithographed design with a smoking pipe and cigarette illustration. Velvet was marketed as \"America's Smoothest Smoke,\" utilizing sun-ripened Kentucky Burley tobacco. This lot is ideal for advertising collectors or period-accurate displays.\nLot includes 10 individual 1.5 oz metal pocket tins\nOriginal cardboard shipping/display box included\nHinged lids with \"Push Up\" opening mechanism\nClassic red, white, and green lithograph graphics\nCondition:\nAll tins are empty. Metal surfaces show oxidation and surface rust, primarily on top rims and interiors. Lithograph graphics exhibit minor scratching and shelf wear consistent with age. The cardboard box shows significant wear, including tears, crushing, and frayed edges as visible in the images.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
