    "description": "Scotch EG T-120 VHS Tape Lot - 49 Tapes\nBlank Media - VHS Format\nLate 1980s/Early 1990s Era\nThis massive lot features 49 original Scotch EG T-120 videocassettes, a staple of the home recording era produced by 3M. Known for their \"Everyday Use\" reliability, these tapes were designed for recording television series, movies, and home videos with a clear signal-to-noise ratio and a lifetime warranty. Finding a bulk quantity of these classic American-made tapes in factory-sealed condition is increasingly rare for media collectors and analog enthusiasts.\n49 Factory-sealed videocassettes (T-120 format)\nStandard Grade for everyday recording needs\nMade in the USA by 3M Consumer Video and Audio Products\nRecording Time: 2 hours (SP), 4 hours (LP), 6 hours (EP/SLP)\nCondition:\nAll 49 tapes are in New In Packaging (NIP) condition, remaining factory sealed in their original clear plastic wrap. The protective cardboard sleeves are well-preserved with sharp corners and vibrant graphics, showing only negligible signs of shelf wear from long-term storage. All units are unused and pristine.\nPayment Extensions -\nDue to demand, we will no longer extend any payment deadlines.\nAuthenticated Items Returns & Refund Disclaimer -\nRefunds and returns must be inquired on within 7 days of receipt of item(s). Returns on authenticated items will be refunded the amount paid for the item (excluding shipping and handling) less a restocking fee.\nCustomer Service -\nCustomer messages are processed Monday through Friday between 7:00am to 3:00 pm EST. We strive to respond to all customer messages within 48 hours.  Inquiries about auctions ending in less than 24 hours may not be answered before the end of the auction.",
